# Store and check out every text file with LF on every OS. This checkout is
# shared between Windows (core.autocrlf=true, CRLF on disk) and Ubuntu/WSL (LF),
# which made Ubuntu's git report 52 files modified when 3 were, and make and
# shell scripts break on CRLF. eol=lf overrides each machine's own setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
